Molecule Studio uses chematic-core, chematic-smiles, chematic-perception and
chematic-depict directly for SMILES parsing, valence and hydrogen counts,
ring perception, 2D coordinates, Kekule bond assignment and CPK colors.
The upstream source is used through these dependencies without modification.

